# Trivy identifies pip's vendored source copies as installed distributions.
# Runtime verification (`pip show` and importlib.metadata) confirms neither
# msgpack nor setuptools is installed in the CYPHERYN API image.
GHSA-6v7p-g79w-8964
CVE-2025-47273

# Trivy is built from the pinned v0.74.0 source commit while its dependencies
# are upgraded during the image build. That makes Go report the main module as
# v0.0.0-...+dirty, so Trivy cannot recognize that these v0.71.x fixes are
# already present in the newer pinned source tree.
CVE-2026-54448
CVE-2026-55092
